Subject: [PATCH 3/4] test/librados: cover ReplicaSplitOp reassembly and
 multi-op reads

Add replica split-op regression tests using patterned data; the
existing tests write zeros, which cannot detect misordered
reassembly. The new cases cover a wrapped chunk window, an
unaligned length producing more chunks than slices, and a read
below the minimum split size in a multi-op request.

Signed-off-by: Sun Yuechi <sunyuechi@iscas.ac.cn>
---
